Clear your calendar for Saturday, December 6th, because you’ve got brunch plans. We’re teaming up with the coffee experts at Rey Sol for a collaboration that’s guaranteed to be the highlight of your week. From 11:30 AM to 3:00 PM, we’re serving up a special menu featuring espresso martinis, killer cocktails, and mocktails that don’t suck. To top it all off, DJ Noktura will be on the decks providing the perfect soundtrack.  

This isn’t your average Saturday brunch. We’ve got two reservation slots: 11:30 AM to 1:00 PM and 1:00 PM to 3:00 PM, and trust us, they’re going to fill up fast. Stick around after your slot for more drinks and amazing vibes. Ready to make some questionable daytime decisions? Book your spot now before they’re all gone.

